## Third-party notices

This repository interoperates with *Cooking Simulator* (App ID 641320, developed
and published by Big Cheese Studio). It contains no game code and redistributes no
game assets.

The perception and GUI layers match screenshots against small icon crops taken from
the game. Those crops are third-party assets and are deliberately **not** included
in this repository; they are regenerated locally from the user's own installation.
See the "Template assets" section of `README.md`.

Cooking Simulator and all associated assets remain the property of their respective
rights holders.
